\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li135\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.   Hallelujah!  Almighty God!\cf0 
\par    We praise you and all thy handwork
\par    We glorify and thank Thee.
\par    So long a time, a thousand years
\par    is long and over, no one knows
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par when His life ever started.
\par    He who, is so Honourable
\par    and so gracious, give Him His praise
\par    Truly He is good evermore.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   2. Hallelujah! We give our thanks
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  our praise and honour and wisdom
\par  To Him Christ the lamb of God.
\par  He came to us in human form
\par  and with His blood He has bought us
\par  we praise His name evermore.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  He redeemed us from our evils
\par  by His blood we are not guilty,
\par \pard       and keep us within His Kingdom.
\par \cf1\ul\b\f1 
\par 
\par }

